  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine crushed digestive biscuits, melted coconut oil, Greek yogurt, honey, sesame seeds, cumin seeds, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well until a smooth dough forms, then refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat a non-stick tava-griddle over medium heat.",
    "Using a spoon, drop small balls of the dough onto the tava-griddle, flattening them slightly with a spatula.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro."
